{"title":"What I’ve been reading","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/920568809/0/marginalrevolution~What-Ive-been-reading.html","date":1750566425000,"content":"<p>Francesca Wade, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Gertrude-Stein-Afterlife-Francesca-Wade/dp/1982186011/ref=sr_1_1?crid=12RZ2H9XFGZN8&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.3uPro9uFWwhKb7wv9Yg3NdflkzAcQhFQzo-KjXbRUxwZ7IPNyTdOnPm3-qW5MRqXPkQsL15q1pw02pYc59EwiAxtZ5pO6Uv4eACgvNfJ69xW6OEExxFFsAjq0eK_JN241h2OIPwhxJCYqTII-MrHtw.4TNmmZEVuSMRF5tjSVVchuSllSf2BKhWg0FKoloR7D0&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=Gertrude+Stein%3A+An+Afterlife&amp;qid=1750522481&amp;sprefix=gertrude+stein+an+afterlife%2Caps%2C223&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Gertrude Stein: An Afterlife</a>.  One of the best-written biographies I have read in years.  I would not say it is close to my core interests, but if you think you might like it you will.</p>\r\n<p>Jacqueline Harpman, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Who-Have-Never-Known-Men/dp/1945492600/ref=sr_1_1?crid=38FFF76AB7K7C&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.47NVAvScu6ZdgBqCTs_2y_6g16BjQCpbMCEongpDRmoedfpDJom4Gg92JcpEhS2Ivvo_JQcFQwK48fpF_Q3KRg.WLtjLMJ5BKruRLSakTz8WIXtR8kd2Ululjxh7uH22ms&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=I+Who+Never+Known+Men&amp;qid=1750522528&amp;sprefix=i+who+never+known+men%2Caps%2C242&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">I Who Never Known Men</a>.  I enjoyed this novel: “Deep Underground, thirty-nine women live imprisoned in a cage.  Watched over by guards, the women have no memory of how they got there, no notion of time, and only a vague recollection of their lives before.”</p>\r\n<p>J.P. Mallory, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Indo-Europeans-Rediscovered-Scientific-Revolution-Rewriting/dp/050002863X/ref=sr_1_1?crid=1APV1B5059B5A&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.lD2E84h1BVqY1_vaoby19A.o0hVNaliPQYA_M88Y_euy34gpLJ6bYb9JLOti5uKh78&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=The+Indo-Europeans+Rediscovered%3A+How+a+Scientific+Revolution+is+Rewriting+Their+Story&amp;qid=1750522601&amp;sprefix=the+indo-europeans+rediscovered+how+a+scientific+revolution+is+rewriting+their+story%2Caps%2C136&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">The Indo-Europeans Rediscovered: How a Scientific Revolution is Rewriting Their Story</a>.  The best book I know of on the origins and unities of Indo-European languages.  I had not known Edward Sapir was born in Pomerania.  And “…the Keres people who occupy seven pueblos (villages) in New Mexico speak a language totally unrelated to any of their neighbours and their origins have been frequently disputed.”</p>\r\n<p>Anthony Trollope, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Phineas-Penguin-Classics-Anthony-Trollope/dp/0140430857/ref=sr_1_1?crid=3F63IQAO0RVGB&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.pMZX2_pH2Ejq973XIiU3YryCIC0m7QugSGK38sECprP7Oc2okz0dpTHS408mw99pbWVtaWg2woRDGpm6Q1zvhPMyednH8wXMX8Vf_H3x-D659AVomeX5vXTkyLSNVrTk-HuKs2t3YsEeEYFeWOjt_bcB0M9pnQylGwiAGZjeOKba8xzS5P5xWZmvgQhipIfHsUnDRJW3cTPT39Oca9cV7BSQb4wdIQoduOgBZa2dPlY.meNqX6r5m0bGeqwoGOSJHXkrfbdKmYlRqsE6CkXdX8w&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=phineas+finn&amp;qid=1750522901&amp;sprefix=phineas+finn%2Caps%2C161&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Phineas Finn</a>.  One of the best Trollope novels it seems, even though it is not (yet?) clear what the plot actually consists of.  <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://chatgpt.com/share/6853ddb2-8394-8010-8694-f04204fe8c71\" target=\"_blank\">Currency decimalization is also one of the side plots</a>, who can argue with that?</p>\r\n<p>Manu S. Pillai, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Gods-Guns-Missionaries-Making-Identity/dp/0670093653/ref=sr_1_1?crid=G7WO7N6WICBO&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.0pp1NoE9AbVqQW1yuZziAw.nH1FWQ3-8WQIGWuucren1lTu9gnGDIMYpICalP1v_os&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=Gods%2C+Guns+and+Missionaries%3A+The+Making+of+the+Modern+Hindu+Identity&amp;qid=1750523161&amp;sprefix=gods%2C+guns+and+missionaries+the+making+of+the+modern+hindu+identity%2Caps%2C269&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Gods, Guns and Missionaries: The Making of the Modern Hindu Identity</a>.  It may be fruitless to argue about this topic on-line, but almost all Westerners under-read when the topic is Hinduism.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/06/what-ive-been-reading-271.html\">What I’ve been reading</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/920568809/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/920568809/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/920568809/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/920568809/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/920568809/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/920568809/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/06/what-ive-been-reading-271.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/06/what-ive-been-reading-271.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https